ns-serif; font-size: 15px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(8, 8, 9); font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px;\">Outstanding performance by \ud835\udc00\ud835\udc1b\ud835\udc21\ud835\udc22\ud835\udc27\ud835\udc1a\ud835\udc2f \ud835\udc0a\ud835\udc2b\ud835\udc22\ud835\udc2d\ud835\udc22 \ud835\udc15\ud835\udc1e\ud835\udc2b\ud835\udc26\ud835\udc1a\ud835\udc27 at the \ud835\udfcf\ud835\udc2c\ud835\udc2d \ud835\udc00\ud835\udc25\ud835\udc25 \ud835\udc08\ud835\udc27\ud835\udc1d\ud835\udc22\ud835\udc1a \ud835\udc0e\ud835\udc29\ud835\udc1e\ud835\udc27 \ud835\udc05\ud835\udc08\ud835\udc03\ud835\udc04 \ud835\udc11\ud835\udc1a\ud835\udc2d\ud835\udc22\ud835\udc27\ud835\udc20 \ud835\udc02\ud835\udc21\ud835\udc1e\ud835\udc2c\ud835\udc2c \ud835\udc02\ud835\udc21\ud835\udc1a\ud835\udc26\ud835\udc29\ud835\udc22\ud835\udc28\ud835\udc27\ud835\udc2c\ud835\udc21\ud835\udc22\ud835\udc29 \ud835\udfd0\ud835\udfce\ud835\udfd0\ud835\udfd3 held in Azamgarh.<\/span><br class=\"html-br\" style=\"color: rgb(8, 8, 9); font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(8, 8, 9); font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px;\">Among 292 players, he secured 3rd Position with an impressive score<\/span><br class=\"html-br\" style=\"color: rgb(8, 8, 9); font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px;\"><br class=\"html-br\" style=\"color: rgb(8, 8, 9); font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px;\"><span class=\"html-span xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xat24cr xm2jcoa x1mpyi22 xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; display: inline-flex; vertical-align: middle; width: 16px; height: 16px; margin-inline: 1px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-top: 0px; padding-inline: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(8, 8, 9); font-size: 15px;\"><img height=\"16\" width=\"16\" class=\"xz74otr x15mokao x1ga7v0g x16uus16 xbiv7yw\" alt=\"\u2705\" referrerpolicy=\"origin-when-cross-origin\" src=\"https:\/\/static.xx.fbcdn.net\/images\/emoji.php\/v9\/t33\/1\/16\/2705.png\" style=\"border: 0px; border-start-start-radius: 0px; border-end-end-radius: 0px; border-start-end-radius: 0px; border-end-start-radius: 0px; object-fit: fill;\"><\/span><span style=\"color: rgb(8, 8, 9); font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px;\">&nbsp;7 Wins |&nbsp;<\/span><span class=\"html-span xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xat24cr xm2jcoa x1mpyi22 xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; display: inline-flex; vertical-align: middle; width: 16px; height: 16px; margin-inline: 1px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-top: 0px; padding-inline: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(8, 8, 9); font-size: 15px;\"><img height=\"16\" width=\"16\" class=\"xz74otr x15mokao x1ga7v0g x16uus16 xbiv7yw\" alt=\"\ud83e\udd1d\" referrerpolicy=\"origin-when-cross-origin\" src=\"https:\/\/static.xx.fbcdn.net\/images\/emoji.php\/v9\/t64\/1\/16\/1f91d.png\" style=\"border: 0px; border-start-start-radius: 0px; border-end-end-radius: 0px; border-start-end-radius: 0px; border-end-start-radius: 0px; object-fit: fill;\"><\/span><span style=\"color: rgb(8, 8, 9); font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px;\">&nbsp;1 Draw<\/span><br class=\"html-br\" style=\"color: rgb(8, 8, 9); font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(8, 8, 9); font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px;\">A truly commendable achievement!&nbsp;<\/span><span class=\"html-span xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xat24cr xm2jcoa x1mpyi22 xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; display: inline-flex; vertical-align: middle; width: 16px; height: 16px; margin-inline: 1px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-top: 0px; padding-inline: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(8, 8, 9); font-size: 15px;\"><img height=\"16\" width=\"16\" class=\"xz74otr x15mokao x1ga7v0g x16uus16 xbiv7yw\" alt=\"\ud83d\udc4f\" referrerpolicy=\"origin-when-cross-origin\" src=\"https:\/\/static.xx.fbcdn.net\/images\/emoji.php\/v9\/tfe\/1\/16\/1f44f.png\" style=\"border: 0px; border-start-start-radius: 0px; border-end-end-radius: 0px; border-start-end-radius: 0px; border-end-start-radius: 0px; object-fit: fill;\"><\/span><span class=\"html-span xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xat24cr xm2jcoa x1mpyi22 xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; display: inline-flex; vertical-align: middle; width: 16px; height: 16px; margin-inline: 1px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-top: 0px; padding-inline: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(8, 8, 9); font-size: 15px;\"><img height=\"16\" width=\"16\" class=\"xz74otr x15mokao x1ga7v0g x16uus16 xbiv7yw\" alt=\"\ud83d\udd25\" referrerpolicy=\"origin-when-cross-origin\" src=\"https:\/\/static.xx.fbcdn.net\/images\/emoji.php\/v9\/t50\/1\/16\/1f525.png\" style=\"border: 0px; border-start-start-radius: 0px; border-end-end-radius: 0px; border-start-end-radius: 0px; border-end-start-radius: 0px; object-fit: fill;\"><\/span>\r\n            \r\n        <div><span class=\"html-span xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xat24cr xm2jcoa x1mpyi22 xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; display: inline-flex; vertical-align: middle; width: 16px; height: 16px; margin-inline: 1px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-top: 0px; padding-inline: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(8, 8, 9); font-size: 15px;\"><br><\/span><\/div>","gallery_type":"achievements","gallery_sub_type":{"id":35,"gallery_type":"achievements","sub_type_name":"sport_academy_achievements","description":"Sport Academy Achievements","is_active":true,"sort_order":0,"created_at":null,"updated_at":null},"gallery_title":"DPS Eldeco Shines at National Level Chess Championship","gallery_slug":"dps-eldeco-shines-at-national-level-chess-championship","status":"active","publish_status":"published","sort_order":0,"page_id":"1140","section_id":null,"school_id":"1","branch_id":"2","language_id":null,"description":null,"meta_title":null,"meta_description":null,"meta_keywords":null,"created_at":"2026-01-30T05:22:58.117000Z","updated_at":"2026-01-30T05:23:14.807000Z","date":"2026-01-08","page":{"id":1140,"title":"Academic Achievements page Eldeco","meta_description":null,"meta_keywords":null,"status":"published","template":"default","created_at":"2025-09-22T03:54:03.120000Z","updated_at":"2025-09-22T10:53:57.417000Z","slug":"academic-achievements-page-eldeco","language_id":"1","language_code":"en","translation_group":"page_group_1758533043_5266","language":"en","school_id":"1","branch_id":"2","breadcrumb_style":null,"breadcrumbs":null,"page_heading":"Academic Achievements page Eldeco","defau