\udc2b-\ud835\udc12\ud835\udc1c\ud835\udc21\ud835\udc28\ud835\udc28\ud835\udc25 \ud835\udc12\ud835\udc24\ud835\udc1a\ud835\udc2d\ud835\udc22\ud835\udc27\ud835\udc20 \ud835\udc02\ud835\udc21\ud835\udc1a\ud835\udc26\ud835\udc29\ud835\udc22\ud835\udc28\ud835\udc27\ud835\udc2c\ud835\udc21\ud835\udc22\ud835\udc29 \ud835\udfd0\ud835\udfce\ud835\udfd0\ud835\udfd4","content":"<div class=\"x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; margin-top: 0.5em; margin-inline: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(8, 8, 9); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">At the Inter-School Skating Competition held at The Millennium School on 5th February 2026, DPS Eldeco skaters delivered an outstanding performance.<\/div><\/div><div class=\"x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space-collapse: preserve; margin-top: 0.5em; margin-inline: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; font-family: &quot;Segoe UI Historic&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(8, 8, 9); font-size: 15px;\"><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span class=\"html-span xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xat24cr xm2jcoa x1mpyi22 xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od\" style=\"text-align: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; display: inline-flex; vertical-align: middle; width: 16px; height: 16px; margin-inline: 1px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-top: 0px; padding-inline: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-top: 0px; font-family: inherit;\"><img height=\"16\" width=\"16\" class=\"xz74otr x15mokao x1ga7v0g x16uus16 xbiv7yw\" alt=\"\ud83e\udd47\" referrerpolicy=\"origin-when-cross-origin\" src=\"https:\/\/static.xx.fbcdn.net\/images\/emoji.php\/v9\/t94\/1\/16\/1f947.png\" style=\"border: 0px; border-start-start-radius: 0px; border-end-end-radius: 0px; border-start-end-radius: 0px; border-end-start-radius: 0px; object-fit: fill;\"><\/span> Gold Medalists : \ud835\udc0f\ud835\udc2e\ud835\udc25\ud835\udc24\ud835\udc22\ud835\udc2d \ud835\udc06\ud835\udc1a\ud835\udc2b\ud835\udc20, \ud835\udc00\ud835\udc27\ud835\udc2f\ud835\udc1e\ud835\udc2c\ud835\udc21\ud835\udc1a \ud835\udc12\ud835\udc28\ud835\udc26\ud835\udc2f\ud835\udc1a\ud835\udc27\ud835\udc2c\ud835\udc21\ud835\udc22 (VII D), \ud835\udc12\ud835\udc21\ud835\udc1a\ud835\udc22\ud835\udc25 \ud835\udc00\ud835\udc27\ud835\udc1a\ud835\udc27\ud835\udc1d (VI D)<\/div><div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><span class=\"html-span xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xat24cr xm2jcoa x1mpyi22 xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od\" style=\"text-align: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; display: inline-flex; vertical-align: middle; width: 16px; height: 16px; margin-inline: 1px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-top: 0px; padding-inline: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-top: 0px; font-family: inherit;\"><img height=\"16\" width=\"16\" class=\"xz74otr x15mokao x1ga7v0g x16uus16 xbiv7yw\" alt=\"\ud83e\udd48\" referrerpolicy=\"origin-when-cross-origin\" src=\"https:\/\/static.xx.fbcdn.net\/images\/emoji.php\/v9\/t15\/1\/16\/1f948.png\" style=\"border: 0px; border-start-start-radius: 0px; border-end-end-radius: 0px; border-start-end-radius: 0px; border-end-start-radius: 0px; object-fit: fill;\"><\/span> Silver Medalists : \ud835\udc15\ud835\udc1a\ud835\udc27\ud835\udc32\ud835\udc1a \ud835\udc0f\ud835\udc1a\ud835\udc2d\ud835\udc21\ud835\udc1a\ud835\udc24 (VI D), \ud835\udc15\ud835\udc1e\ud835\udc1e\ud835\udc24\ud835\udc2c\ud835\udc21\ud835\udc1a \ud835\udc13\ud835\udc2b\ud835\udc22\ud835\udc29\ud835\udc1a\ud835\udc2d\ud835\udc21\ud835\udc22 (VII F), \ud835\udc00\ud835\udc24\ud835\udc2c\ud835\udc21\ud835\udc1a\ud835\udc2d\ud835\udc1a \ud835\udc12\ud835\udc1a\ud835\udc26\ud835\udc1a\ud835\udc27\u